OL,3,GNEWSACity development body
OL,4,A'undemocratic' says Ed Davey
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of the Liberal Democrats has
OL,7,Fattacked the new authority which will
OL,8,Foversee development in the Cambridge
OL,9,Farea as "undemocratic and slightly
OL,10,Fchaotic".
OL,12,FSir Ed Davey said he was worried that
OL,13,Fonce the Greater Cambridge Development
OL,14,FCorporation (GCDC) took over
OL,15,Fresponsibility for major growth
OL,16,Fprojects it would be harder for
OL,17,Fresidents to raise concerns and for
OL,18,Fplanning applications to be altered.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
