OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACity development body
OL,4,A'undemocratic' says Ed Davey
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe corporation, expected to start work
OL,7,Fnext year, insisted it would work
OL,8,Fclosely with local authorities and be
OL,9,Faccountable.
OL,11,FThe body, which will take on the
OL,12,Fplanning powers of local authorities,
OL,13,Fhas been set up by the government to
OL,14,Fdrive sustainable growth in one of the
OL,15,FUK's fastest growing cities.
